8. Introduction to your project. (Please include a clear overview of what your project is and why this is something that you want to work on.)

Rena labs is building a TEE data infrastructure, and it has a product named Insider Cash. 
Insider Cash is a market-making integrity dashboard built on Rena’s TEE Data Exchange Room, ensuring token integrity and long-term sustainability. It enables token issuers to monitor real-time liquidity provision by contracted market makers, including the detection of potential abnormal activities, within a verifiable and confidential environment.

9. What problem are you trying to solve, and why is it important?
Market making transparency. 
If no one is monitoring the market makers, then the foundation and founders will suffer from suspicious trading all the time. And it is very bad for token holders and the ecosystem. As for good market makers, it is also very hard for them to prove their integrity comparing with the bad market makers. 

10. What is your proposed solution?
We are building our data infra with TEE, and produce an integrity dashboard for foundations. It can monitor the market makers’ trading behaviors by AI models. All the trading data will be contributed by the CEX API directly and the analysis is run in TEE. Nobody has the access to review the raw data. Founders can understand if the market makers are doing something wrong, or good market makers can prove their integrity without leaking raw data. 

